  "content": [
    {
      "text": "God made a wind to pass over the earth, Gen. 8:1. Thou didst blow with thy wind, Ex. 15:10. strong wind rent the mountains, 1 Kgs. 19:11. he causeth his wind to blow, Ps. 147:18. stormy wind fulfilling his word, Ps. 148:8. He … shall inherit the wind, Prov. 11:29. north wind driveth away rain, Prov. 25:23. He that observeth the wind shall not sow, Eccl. 11:4. dry wind … not to fan, Jer. 4:11. prophets shall become wind, Jer. 5:13. I will raise up against Babylon … a destroying wind, Jer. 51:1. Prophesy unto the wind, Ezek. 37:9. they have sown the wind, Hosea 8:7. he that … createth the wind, Amos 4:13. Lord sent out a great wind into the sea, Jonah 1:4.",
